# --- added before the first push ---

# Secrets. `.env` above matches any directory, so backend/.env is covered, but
# it does NOT match a differently-named file: frontend/.env.local was tracked
# by the old rules. The `.example` files stay in the repo on purpose -- they
# are the documentation of which variables must be set, with no values.
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env

# A full PostgreSQL 18 installation and a uv package cache live in the working
# tree. Neither is source, both are hundreds of megabytes, and GitHub rejects
# individual files over 100MB.
.tools/
.uv-cache/

# Editor state.
.idea/

# Runtime output. run_local.log is 1.5MB of application logging; it holds no
# API key today (checked), but a log is exactly the file that starts holding
# one after an unlucky exception, so it does not belong in version control.
run_local.log
*.log

# Working scratch, none of it source:
#   _to_delete/        tarballs and snapshots kept for recovery
#   .codex_audit_tmp/  rendered PNGs of the exported workbooks
#   Claude outputs/    copies of files that already exist under backend/
#   _pgfix/            one-off database repair scratch
#   fe4.tgz            a frontend snapshot
_to_delete/
.codex_audit_tmp/
Claude outputs/
_pgfix/
fe4.tgz
*.tgz

# Company and client material: the TTS document pack, its QA renders and the
# distribution zip. Excluded deliberately rather than by oversight -- it is
# 15MB of documents rather than code, and a tender's contents are confidential
# to the customer even in a private repository. The local copy is untouched.
company_document_pack/

# Exported matrices carry requirement and evidence text from live bids.
*.xlsx
!docs/**/*.xlsx

# --- added for the rfp_best upload ---

# Customer tenders and everything built from them (ADX, Jadwa): confidential to the customer even in
# a private repository. The review folder keeps only the two scripts that are source.
review/*
!review/verify_audit_package.py
!review/run_full_checks.py
jadwa_rfp.pdf
exports/

# Rotated logs (`*.log` does not match run_local.log.1), archives, scratch folders.
run_local.log*
*.zip
_pending/

# Stray empty files created by shell mishaps.
/cd
/No
/The
.git_old/
